OL,3,GNEWSANew breast cancer unit officially
OL,4,Aopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new breast care unit in Stafford is
OL,7,Fdue to be officially opened.
OL,9,FThe facility at the County Hospital
OL,10,Fstarted operating earlier this year and
OL,11,Fthe University Hospitals of North
OL,12,FMidlands said it had made a real
OL,13,Fdifference for patients and staff.
OL,15,FThe NHS Trust said it brought "breast
OL,16,Fcare services together under one roof".
OL,18,FIt also said it provided patients "with
OL,19,Fa modern and welcoming environment
OL,20,Fdesigned to improve their experience
OL,21,Ffrom diagnosis through to treatment".
